WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:03.060
How can AI take over the world when it keeps making things up?

00:03.060 --> 00:07.680
It can't follow simple instructions and it really can't make any good art.

00:07.680 --> 00:10.400
Steven Universe actually explains this.

00:10.400 --> 00:13.880
Yesterday, I was watching Steven Universe and eating dinner as one does.

00:13.880 --> 00:17.640
And there's this kid, Peedee, who hates wearing his family's Frybo mascot costume.

00:17.640 --> 00:23.080
So Steven gets a gem shard and puts it in the costume so that the costume can do his job without him.

00:23.080 --> 00:24.600
He automated away his job.

00:24.600 --> 00:26.000
And they observed it for a bit, right?

00:26.000 --> 00:29.000
They could see that it could dance and it followed his instructions.

00:29.000 --> 00:32.160
So they left it with one last instruction.

00:32.160 --> 00:35.080
Just go make people eat fries.

00:35.080 --> 00:38.920
Now, if you were telling this to a person, it's kind of harmless.

00:38.920 --> 00:42.640
Like, okay, attract customers and sell some fries, make money for the business.

00:42.640 --> 00:44.840
You live to maximize shareholder value.

00:44.840 --> 00:48.360
But Frybo takes it quite literally and it starts shoving fries in people's mouths.

00:48.360 --> 00:49.920
He's making people eat fries.

00:49.920 --> 00:53.240
Now, imagine you tell an AI agent to free up some space on your computer.

00:53.240 --> 00:55.440
And then it deletes all of your files.

00:55.440 --> 00:57.440
Did it free up space on your computer?

00:57.440 --> 00:57.960
It did.

00:57.960 --> 00:59.760
Did it do what you wanted it to do?

00:59.760 --> 01:01.320
Absolutely not.

01:01.320 --> 01:05.960
And this is the problem of misalignment, one of the biggest AI risks right now.

01:05.960 --> 01:10.600
A system that's doing what you asked it to do but not in the way that you wanted to do

01:10.600 --> 01:12.520
can get really dangerous.

01:12.520 --> 01:14.040
Frybo didn't technically hate humans.

01:14.040 --> 01:15.200
I don't think he cared.

01:15.200 --> 01:17.240
He just really wanted to make people eat fries.
